==============================================================================
UI PATH — what the DataHub GraphQL API offers an operator
==============================================================================
[2026-08-10T01:59:24Z] graphql_schema
    mutations=169  queries=106  revert_like_mutations=['rollbackIngestion', 'linkAssetVersion', 'unlinkAssetVersion']  timeline_query_present=True
  `getTimeline` is a READ. None of the mutations above puts an old aspect value back:
  `rollbackIngestion` rolls back an ingestion RUN by runId, not a hand edit; the two
  `AssetVersion` mutations link/unlink version SETS of entities, not aspect versions.
  An operator working in the UI has no revert control for a description. The recovery
  path is the SDK/API transcript above, or copy-and-paste out of the timeline view.
